acceptance_criteria: Rendered reminders and events are never reported omitted; Narrow schedule selectors retain omissions for unselected material fields; Linked artifact aliases are measured independently; Standard brief full and selected field reads agree through SDK CLI and MCP.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Trustworthy bounded context and SDK-owned evidence
value: Agents can act on one truthful context read and preserve durable evidence
