actual_result: "Real disposable schedule.deadline, reminder/event and linked-artifact projections pass in the 48-case focused suite; owner-linked tests and thirteen isolated safe/source-mutant controls pass with unchanged budgets. Installed Node/Bun acceptance and strict live history pass. Final hosted coverage and all exact-head review/check admission remain required before the same implementation PR merges."
