  "2026-10-04T13:52:20.124Z","harness:codex","Final-head evidence before provenance refinement: CI 37205472336 passed all 9707 tests with two Windows-only cases skipped on Linux. Every metric on all 763 source rows was 100/100/100/100: 63551 lines, 66665 statements, 13770 functions and 51022 branches. Its only static failure was missing planning fields on unclaimed intake pm-gh1394; those were supplied using the CLI and record-integrity now passes. The new provenance refinement requires fresh exact-head hosted admission before merge."
  "2026-10-04T14:01:33.982Z","harness:codex","Final live reliability: required telemetry/Sentry gate passes with zero critical/high events in the fresh fourteen-day window. The collector query at 2026-10-04T13:57:38Z contains 17373 one-day finish events and 444 failures (2.56 percent), with zero failures missing error codes. This proves recent action logging and coded failures, not complete end-to-end trace coverage. Dependabot, code-scanning and secret-scanning open alerts are all zero; pnpm audit finds no known vulnerabilities."
  "2026-10-04T14:09:08.530Z","harness:codex","Both final owner-linked test executions are recorded through the CLI; the real schedule.deadline case and schedule/artifact receipt assertions pass. Closure records the implemented behavior and observed local acceptance; exact final-head hosted 100-percent source coverage and all required checks remain merge prerequisites. Historical status, semantic documentation debt, provider quota limits, trace completeness and immutable daily publication are retained as distinct evidence boundaries."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T14:04:48.939Z","harness:codex","Acceptance boundaries: schedule.deadline is selected and checked directly in the shared table; reminders/events inclusion is checked independently. Dependency attribution receives its own material omission group and explicit restoration, with unknown-result malformed-row coverage at the generic receipt boundary. Structural/exported/member source documentation gates pass; the pre-existing semantic filler inventory remains 4131 across 204 files under pm-dvwm, and is not claimed remediated by this delivery."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T13:07:24.187Z","harness:codex","Omission receipts must inspect emitted aliases rather than only original metadata keys. An empty unselected linked placeholder proves envelope shape, not returned content. Mutation controls should assert the entire public outcome so an independent defensive exception cannot accidentally substitute for the intended behavioral failure."
