body: "GitHub report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1389\nReported version: 2026.10.4\n\nA material reminder or event rendered through the normalized schedule facet is still called omitted because the receipt inspects only top-level metadata keys. Derive inclusion from actual alias paths and preserve recovery for unselected members.\n\nThe complete public issue and its comments were read. This record is intake; the report is not independently reproduced or fixed yet. The completed predecessor pm-x1g5 remains shipped work and is not represented as an outstanding failure.\n\nAcceptance: Rendered reminders and events are never reported omitted; Narrow schedule selectors retain omissions for unselected material fields; Linked artifact aliases are measured independently; Standard brief full and selected field reads agree through SDK CLI and MCP."
